# Byte-compiled files from the host: a macOS __pycache__ has no business in a
# Linux image, and it is tracked in this repo, so it would otherwise be copied.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# The macOS side of the project. None of it runs in a container.
#
# menubar.py is deliberately NOT excluded: dropping a module out of a package would
# mean a future import of it breaks only inside the image, which is exactly the kind
# of bug that does not reproduce locally. It is 15 KB, __main__ imports it lazily,
# and it costs nothing to carry.
firewatch-ctl
*.plist

# Everything that is not the application.
.git/
.DS_Store
docs/
deploy/
*.sh
*.sh.bak
fire-detection-*
zavidovici-granica.gpx
tests_events.py
